sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): State is Authorized AND<br>EVConnectedPreSession AND<br>ISO15118SmartCharging

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = Configured evseId, maxScheduleTuples and chargingNeeds = Configured values from mock EV)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse (status = Accepted or Processing)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted or Processing

    Note over CS,CSMS: If NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse status was Processing,<br>the Test System will wait 60 seconds for the request
    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (evseId, chargingProfilePurpose = TxProfile, transactionId)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId = Configured evseId<br>chargingProfilePurpose = TxProfile<br>transactionId = Provided transactionId from before
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = Configured evseId, chargingSchedule = ChargingSchedule provided at step 3)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted
